  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1501.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1501.01 Purpose. The purpose of this Chapter is to establish criteria and procedures for administering the per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS) removal rebate program for private wells authorized by RSA 485-H:3, II-a.\n\nSource. #14201, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1500.html"
